whisper.cpp v1.9.1: security fixes from upstream, applied after the DTW
median-filter backport (whisper-dtw-median-filter.patch). scripts/48-whisper.sh
applies this file and checks that each fix is in the tree afterwards.

  60c0be6a whisper : add check for ttype in whisper and parakeet (#4091)
           CVE-2026-110810: out-of-bounds read in whisper_model_load on a
           model file whose tensor type is out of range. Fixed in v1.9.5.
  df1547b6 whisper,parakeet : reject invalid n_dims in tensor header to
           prevent stack-buffer-overflow on malformed model files (#3957)
  8631825d whisper : heap out-of-bounds read in log_mel_spectrogram on very
           short audio (#3956)

Upstream ships them in v1.9.5, together with 773 other commits, most of them
in ggml, which whisper, stemsplit and lyricsalign all run on. These three are
taken alone so that ggml stays the one every gate of those filters was
measured on. Drop this file when whisper.cpp is bumped to v1.9.5 or later.

